t roughly half a million for Hull, funding a consistent campaign presence, and Barack Obama's endorsement added high-profile reinforcement.\n\nHull has struggled for traction; appearing alone at a debate after Haaland skipped it drew attention, while opinion writers have pressed for a fuller airing of her record. Race raters broadly place the contest in Likely or Solid Democratic territory, and prediction markets price a Democratic win at about 94 percent. The open seat keeps some uncertainty, but the evidence points to Haaland as a clear favorite.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.9664, "margin": 10.58}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.9571, "margin": 10.0}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.9605, "margin": 10.0}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.948, "margin": 10.2}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.9415, "margin": 9.5}, {"date": "2026-09-27", "p_dem": 0.9502, "margin": 10.5}, {"date": "2026-09-28", "p_dem": 0.9552, "margin": 10.0}, {"date": "2026-09-29", "p_dem": 0.9463, "margin": 9.0}, {"date": "2026-09-30", "p_dem": 0.9506, "margin": 9.5}, {"date": "2026-10-01", "p_dem": 0.9559, "margin": 9.5}, {"date": "2026-10-02", "p_dem": 0.9507, "margin": 10.0}, {"date": "2026-10-03", "p_dem": 0.9606, "margin": 10.0}, {"date": "2026-10-04", "p_dem": 0.9549, "margin": 10.5}, {"date": "2026-10-05", "p_dem": 0.9273, "margin": 8.5}, {"date": "2026-10-06", "p_dem": 0.9256, "margin": 8.5}, {"date": "2026-10-07", "p_dem": 0.9234, "margin": 8.5}, {"date": "2026-10-08", "p_dem": 0.9241, "margin": 8.0}, {"date": "2026-10-09", "p_dem": 0.9268, "margin": 8.5}, {"date": "2026-10-10", "p_dem": 0.923, "margin": 8.5}, {"date": "2026-10-11", "p_dem": 0.9163, "margin": 8.0}, {"date": "2026-10-12", "p_dem": 0.9397, "margin": 8.0}, {"date": "2026-10-13", "p_dem": 0.9351, "margin": 8.0}, {"date": "2026-10-14", "p_dem": 0.9301, "margin": 8.5}, {"date": "2026-10-15", "p_dem": 0.9278, "margin": 8.0}, {"date": "2026-10-16", "p_dem": 0.9324, "margin": 8.5}]}